{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-14T04:05:43.420Z","author":"codex-ops272-1114","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"878a1385031b4e791eaca683","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/3","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-14T04:05:43.420Z","author":"codex-ops272-1114","text":"Decision table for #272:\n| Part | Evidence | Decision |\n| (a) Item-less windows | New real tracker + dependency-only Git commit executes the parsed reusable workflow step. Baseline fails MISSING_REQUESTED_RELEASE; forwarding --include-empty to the three pm-changelog hooks passes. pm test also passed 1/1. | Fix at pm-ops workflow layer; no pm-changelog change. Preserve unchanged-tree and daily publication caps. |\n| (b) Superseded PRs | Initial targeted suite 139/139, including owned-only cleanup, successor receipt re-read, retirement and failed-close recovery. | Existing canonical behavior is sufficient. |\n| (c) Cross-repository OIDC | Current npm docs validate caller release.yml. Exact local preflight exits 1 because this session has no Actions OIDC endpoint. The prerequisite self-caller request job accepted the pm-ops identity at 04:04:01Z: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/actions/runs/43553624308/job/132323825169. This is same-repository proof only. | Cross-repository live receipt still required before activation; absence is not rejection, so no copied-workflow fallback. |\nPilots selected: pm-lint and pm-jira, both with include-empty already in package scripts. Preserve pm-lint string-valued approval/exact repository/main gate and pm-jira release:update-version. Both already cover github-actions in Dependabot. Await new pm-ops release before editing/pinning either workflow. Remaining rollout: 34 authorized packages listed in docs/release-diagnosis-propagation.md; exclude pm-cli, preserve package hooks, run caller/attestation/YAML/actionlint/changelog and exact-head CI checks in small batches. Only orchestrator merges and dispatches."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-14T04:05:43.420Z"}],"before_hash":"af32a3c3ce1e4dcef816f0bd0cdc49822d7892a69fd0441f2547a297aa0d075f","after_hash":"5f244fcce7b2730a4778349575188648375716c4fd347a8b48c06100669e5638","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"4b97acf7e45fc23c248da31ee59f43b6eaf555fb79f4325ee8333557423ef7a3"}
